---
globs: '**/README.md'
---

- Use `https://example.com` for placeholder URLs (content URLs, callback URLs, webhook URLs)
- Use `dummy-token` for placeholder tokens (apiToken)
- Optional params with defaults: `// name?: type (default: value)` as comment, or inline `value, // (default: value)` when the param is shown
- Optional params without defaults: `// name?: type` (omit the default portion). Prefer this over `// (optional)`
- Omit documentation for APIs that are broken or non-functional
